{"id":"bfb27aea6f90ca07","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-term-interpretation.md","title":"项解释","display":"df-term-interpretation — 项解释","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-term-interpretation","aliases":["28-df-term-interpretation"],"display":"df-term-interpretation — 项解释","depends_on":["[[28-df-structure]]","[[28-df-assignment]]","[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]"],"source_status":"local-support-definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-term-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-term-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term-interpretation — 项解释"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7046e83df52059de\" href=\"?note=7046e83df52059de\" title=\"28-df-structure\">28-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd01c8f753367315\" href=\"?note=fd01c8f753367315\" title=\"28-df-assignment\">28-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-support-definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-term-interpretation-—-项解释-$t^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\beta$\">df-term-interpretation — 项解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta]\">\\(t^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta]\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是所列一阶语法定义中的固定签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak{A})\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak{A})\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-结构, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7046e83df52059de\" href=\"?note=7046e83df52059de\" title=\"28-df-structure\">28-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak{A}|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak{A}|\\)</span> (论域, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7046e83df52059de\" href=\"?note=7046e83df52059de\" title=\"28-df-structure\">28-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta: \\mathrm{Var} \\to A\">\\(\\beta: \\mathrm{Var} \\to A\\)</span> (赋值, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fd01c8f753367315\" href=\"?note=fd01c8f753367315\" title=\"28-df-assignment\">28-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t,t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span> (项, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)\">\\(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\)</span> (常量符号, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元函数符号, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> (变量符号, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta] \\coloneqq \\begin{cases}\\beta(x)&amp;t=x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\\\c^{\\mathfrak{A}}&amp;t=c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\\\f^{\\mathfrak{A}}(t_1^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_n^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta])&amp;t=f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),\\;f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta] \\coloneqq \\begin{cases}\\beta(x)&amp;t=x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\\\c^{\\mathfrak{A}}&amp;t=c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\\\f^{\\mathfrak{A}}(t_1^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_n^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta])&amp;t=f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),\\;f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该递归分别处理变量、常量和复合项，且其值属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源状态：本目录的自足支撑定义；不把此形式语言包装或模型论扩展冒称原书编号定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-term-interpretation-—-项解释-$t^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\beta$","text":"df-term-interpretation — 项解释 $t^{\\mathfrak{A}}[\\beta]$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"7046e83df52059de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fd01c8f753367315","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"acf90b9de82eb78c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-d